q                   5.H23           P122.H23         P132.H23         # serial 62 WA2 X5.H23
q                   1.N1            P12P.N1          P13P.N1          # serial 63 PAF A1.N1
q                   1.C6            P12P.C6          P13P.C6          # serial 64 PAF A1.C6
